    rcap:evidenceSection "10.6" ;
    rcap:evidenceText "The high titer convalescent plasma (active intervention specified in this DSA and designated the intervention code ‘P4’) will be nested with the (low titer) convalescent plasma intervention (intervention code ‘P2’ and the active intervention in earlier versions of this DSA approved in regions other than the United States) in the Immune Suppressed and Non-Immune Suppressed Strata." ;
    rcap:occurrenceKind "allocation_nesting" .

